 No code specific to your bot can be written before the window opens."],["I have never been to a hackathon. Is that okay?","Absolutely. Most participants are beginners joining their first hackathon. No prior experience is required, just curiosity and a willingness to learn."],["What skills do I need?","No prior poker or coding experience is required. Teams mix skill levels, and what matters most is a willingness to learn, collaborate and have fun."],["Who can sign up?","Current students enrolled at any Australian university or TAFE. You do not have to be Melbourne based: the hackathon runs virtually, so you can take part from anywhere."],["How do I sign up?",e.jsxs("ol",{className:"list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1",children:[e.jsxs("li",{children:["Join the"," ",e.jsx("a",{className:"text-accent underline underline-offset-4",href:"https://discord.gg/kkv2hJyzGp",children:"Poker Bot Hackathon Discord"}),"."]}),e.jsxs("li",{children:["Every team member buys their own ticket on ",e.jsx(xe,{}),". MAC members get member pricing there."]}),e.jsxs("li",{children:[e.jsx(M,{className:"text-accent underline underline-offset-4",to:"/login",children:"Register your team on this site"}),", listing every teammate with the email they used on Humanitix."]}),e.jsx("li",{children:"Show up in person to the opening ceremony or tune in online."})]})],["How much does it cost?",e.jsxs(e.Fragment,{children:["$5 for MAC members, $10 for non-members, paid per person on ",e.jsx(xe,{}),". Become a member at"," ",e.jsx("a",{className:"text-accent underline underline-offset-4",href:"https://monashcoding.com",children:"monashcoding.com"}),"."]})],["I don't have a team. Can I still sign up?","Yes. Compete as an individual, or find a team on the Discord or at the opening ceremony."],["What is the team size?","1 to 4 members per team."],["Can we use AI?","AI tools for coding, debugging, brainstorming and research are allowed. AI, LLM or any other network calls at runtime are not: your bot's in-game decisions must come from code your team wrote."],["How are the winners decided?","Bots are grouped and play a series of games each round, earning points based on their final chip count in each game. Results across all 4 rounds decide the rankings, and the top three win prizes. The games are replayed at the closing ceremony in person and on this site. See the format above for the full details."],["What do we build the bot in?","Python, using the provided bot template and game engine. Both unlock when the hackathon starts."]];function os(){return e.jsxs("section",{id:"faq",className:"scroll-mt-24 px-6 sm:px-16 pb-24 w-full",children:[e.jsxs(q,{children:[e.jsx(k,{className:"mb-3",children:"FAQ"}),e.jsx("h2",{className:"text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight",children:"Questions, answered"})]}),e.jsx("div",{className:"mt-10 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-x-14",children:rs.map(([s,t],n)=>e.jsx(q,{delay:Math.min(n,6)*.03,children:e.jsxs("details",{className:"group border-t border-white/10 py-5",children:[e.jsxs("summary",{className:"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 font-semibold transition-colors hover:text-accent",children:[s,e.jsx("span",{className:"text-white/30 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-45 text-xl leading-none",children:"+"})]}),e.jsx("div",{className:"mt-3 text-white/55 leading-relaxed max-w-[70ch]",children:t})]})},s))})]})}function is(){const s=Fe();return h.useEffect(()=>{var t;s.hash&&((t=document.getElementById(s.hash.slice(1)))==null||t.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth"}))},[s.hash]),e.jsx(Je,{children:e.jsxs("div",{className:"min-h-screen",children:[e.jsx(Xt,{}),e.jsxs("main",{children:[e.jsx(es,{}),e.jsx(ns,{}),e.jsx(as,{}),e.jsx(os,{})]}),e.jsx(Zt,{})]})})}function ls(){const s=V(C.bots.addMember),t=Ke(),[n,a]=h.useState(""),[i,r]=h.useState(""),[c,l]=h.useState(""),[d,o]=h.useState(""),[u,m]=h.useState(!1);async function p(b){if(b.preventDefault(),!u){m(!0),l(""),o("");try{const f={name:n.trim(),email:i.trim()},g=